        return if (isHindi) {
            "Ghabrao mat, saans lo! 🤝 Aakhri waqt me panic karne ki jagah yeh **Emergency High-Yield Strategy** follow karo:\n\n" +
                    "1. **80/20 Rule (Pramukh Topics Pehle)**:\n" +
                    "   - Poora syllabus padhne ki koshish mat karo. Pichle saal ke questions (PYQs) uthao aur jo topics baar-baar aate hain sirf unhe target karo.\n\n" +
                    "2. **Active Recall & Formulas**:\n" +
                    "   - Chapter ke main formulas, definitions, aur diagrams ek paper par note karo.\n\n" +
                    "3. **Triage Study (Agla 3 Ghanta)**:\n" +
                    "   - Mujhko batao kis subject aur chapter ka exam hai? Main tumhe turant **Top 5 most recurring questions aur unke simple solutions** bata dunga.\n\n" +
                    "*Subject ka naam batao, abhi shuru karte hain!*"
        } else {
            "Don't panic, take a deep breath! 🤝 Here is an **Emergency High-Yield Triage Plan** for tonight:\n\n" +
                    "1. **Apply the 80/20 Rule**:\n" +
                    "   - Don't try to read everything cover-to-cover. Focus exclusively on the highest-weightage topics and past-year recurring questions.\n\n" +
                    "2. **Master Core Cheat-Sheets**:\n" +
                    "   - Focus on key definitions, summary formulas, and visual diagrams.\n\n" +
                    "3. **Targeted Drill Right Now**:\n" +
                    "   - Tell me which subject and chapters you are facing tomorrow. I will provide you with the top 5 essential questions and intuitive breakdowns immediately.\n\n" +
                    "*Which subject is your exam on? Let's tackle it together!*"
        }
